---
description: Support full project audits and automatically repair missing project state files
alwaysApply: true
---

For `status`:
- ensure PROGRESS.md, PROJECT_STATE.md, CLAUDE.md, CURSOR.md and required .ai-kit state exist
- create missing state from verified repository/docs evidence
- then report status

For `review project` / `audit project`:
- run a repository-wide read-only audit
- use project-audit
- classify findings BLOCKER/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/INFO
- update PROGRESS.md with verified findings
- do not change application code


For `status`, stop after reporting status. Never fix or review code.
For `review project`, Git is optional; audit repository files directly when Git is absent. Never initialize Git just to perform review.
